sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Nutzer
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant P as Policy
    participant WS as Workspace/Git
    participant AD as Adapter (Sandbox)
    participant QG as Quality Gate
    participant AU as Audit

    U->>O: Run anlegen
    O->>P: Adapter/Modell prüfen
    P-->>O: erlaubt / DENIED
    O->>AU: Policy-Version attestieren
    O->>WS: Workspace + Artefakte
    WS->>WS: Remote-Sync, Branch abzweigen
    O->>U: Freigabe? (laut Policy)
    U-->>O: freigegeben
    O->>AD: Prompt ausführen (Stream)
    AD-->>O: Diff + Exitcode
    O->>QG: Reviewer auf den Diff
    QG-->>O: PASS / WARN / FAIL
    alt Gate oder Build FAIL
        O->>AD: Korrekturlauf (max. 2)
    else PASS
        O->>WS: Merge oder Pull Request
        O->>AU: Run abgeschlossen
    end
